__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
checkpoints/
*.jsonl

# Arteries/marrow runtime state.
# Nothing under these has ever been tracked in this repo, so they are ignored
# wholesale rather than by file. Note the asymmetry with capillaries, where
# .arteries/hooks/, config.json and smoke.sh ARE tracked as configuration —
# if these hooks should be under version control here too, that is a separate
# decision, not something this rule blocks.
.arteries/
.marrow/
